[statement]
The order of a request does not matter, unlike the order of a package's
dependencies (`dependency-order-decides-a-shared-virtual-y-first`): asked
for `y x`, apk installs `p2` alone, which provides both.

[repository]
P:p1
V:1.0-r0
p:x
k:100

P:p2
V:1.0-r0
p:x y=1
k:10

[request]
y
x

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install p2 1.0-r0
